{"channelId":"UCPvNTD1GuxPR8LXCuD-cbTw","row":["44 Cats - English",1520000,"Welcome to the Official 44 Cats YouTube Channel! 🐱✨\n\nJoin the adventures of the most pawsome musical band in town: the Buffycats! Meet Lampo, the brave leader; Milady, the master of cat-fu; Pilou, the sweetest kitten; and Meatball, the funniest and hungriest of the group! 🎸🐾\nLiving in Granny Pina’s Garage, our four furry friends use their unique superpowers—and the energy from Granny’s legendary noodles—to help friends in need and protect the city from the mischievous Boss, Blister, Scab, and the catcatchers!\n\nOn this channel, you will find:\n🎬 Full Episodes and the best clips from the series\n🎶 Catchy Kids' Songs and nursery rhymes to sing and dance along\n🧸 Fun Toy Videos and unboxing adventures\n🎨 Creative DIY crafts and activities for the whole family\n\nSubscribe now and ring the bell to stay pawsome with us every day! 🔔🐾","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPvNTD1GuxPR8LXCuD-cbTw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPvNTD1GuxPR8LXCuD-cbTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:28.852Z","channelId":"UCPvNTD1GuxPR8LXCuD-cbTw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b7cd63442f7220558944eb64a2880e71c4c6e0f5af1619442c9061f3b06c3526","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7cd4d16f812f56831ffc3be8fec382f9511fa1e101eaaf18adb0e88f2b2accbc"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPvNTD1GuxPR8LXCuD-cbTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:28.852Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPvNTD1GuxPR8LXCuD-cbTw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1520000,"raw":"1.52M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPvNTD1GuxPR8LXCuD-cbTw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:28.852Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.44cats.tv/en/contact","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:46:51.680Z"}],"matchedKeywords":[